  "_note": "The contract between the Pod (pkg/cards) and the phone (ghost-app lib/cards-contract.json). Both sides test every case here. A card the Pod accepts must show the same number of blocks on the phone; a card the Pod rejects must never reach one. Keep the two copies identical.",
